PART 0 — RECALL: WHAT THIS PROOF IS FOR

Before the proof, the frame. Because a proof without a purpose is just symbol manipulation.

0.1 The Three Fixes

A standard fixes three things, in three layers. Each layer closes a different degree of freedom.

Layer What it fixes How it's closed Result
Fix 1 — Architecture The shape of the agent A0–A9 (spec suite) Convergent design: two independent engineers produce structurally identical systems
Fix 2 — Behavior Nothing — and correctly so Deployment defines content Same grammar, divergent content. This freedom is the point.
Fix 3 — Safety The guarantee This proof Safety becomes fact, not claim

The first fix is closed by writing specs. The second fix is deliberately not closed — a standard that fixed content would be a product, not a standard. The third fix is closed only by the formal proof below.

Without the proof, A0–A9 are well-formed but unbacked. With the proof, they become load-bearing.

0.2 The A0–A9 Suite — the Objects the Proof is About

The agentic extension is not one paper. It is a family of specs, because the extension is a system.

